ide the card, on the left, a green circle containing a white check‑mark icon.  \n  - To the right of the icon, a bold heading “Password Reset Successful”.  \n  - Below the heading, two lines of body text providing instructions.  \n  - No visible buttons, links, or additional controls on this screen.  \n\n**3. EXTRACTED TEXT**  \nPassword Reset Successful  \nA confirmation email has been sent to your registered address.  \nSign in with your new password to confirm access.  \n\n**4. ERRORS AND WARNINGS**  \nnone visible  \n\n**5. LIKELY ISSUE CATEGORY AND SEVERITY**  \n- **Category:** Account/authentication  \n- **Severity:** Low  \n- **Reason:** The page explicitly states that the password reset was successful; there is no error or problem indicated, only a confirmation step for the user.\n\n**6. OBSERVED FACTS VS INFERENCE**  \n\n*OBSERVED FACTS:*  \n- The browser address bar shows `passwordreset.corp.example.com/done`.  \n- A green check‑mark icon is displayed.  \n- The heading reads “Password Reset Successful”.  \n- The body text states a confirmation email was sent and instructs the user to sign in with the new password.  \n\n*INFERENCE:*  \n- The user has likely initiated a password reset request prior to reaching this page.  \n- The system has processed the request and sent the email; the user now needs to check their email and set a new password.  \n- No technical failure or error is evident from the visible content.\n\n**7. CONFIDENCE SCORE & NOTES**  \nCONFIDENCE SCORE: 0.98  \nCONFIDENCE LEVEL: High  \nCONFIDENCE REASON: The page content is fully legible, the URL is clear, and the success message is unambiguous; no visual ambiguities or missing information affect interpretation.\n\nOutputs\nUser successfully signs in with the new password\nConfirmation email received at the registered address\n✅ No helpdesk ticket required\nFAQs\nQ: What if I don't receive the verification code?\nCheck your spam folder and wait two minutes before requesting a resend. If it 